<%# yield inserts the plain text content from the specific mailer template %>
<%# This is the text-only version of email layouts (no HTML) %>
<%# When sending emails, Rails sends both HTML and plain text versions %>
<%# Some email clients or users prefer plain text emails for accessibility and simplicity %>
<%# This layout is as simple as possible because plain text emails have no formatting %>
<%# The mailer templates themselves provide all the content - this just passes it through %>
<%= yield %>
